## Context

- Run 16: no assigned tasks. Comprehensive literature scan across all 6 active initiatives + watchlist follow-ups.
- Created journal entry #2750 with 8 findings + watchlist updates.
- Created 3 tasks: research_director #1654 (TridentTCR for GAS-mimicry TCR prediction, P3), #1655 (cDC-specific cGAS refinement for two-hit model, P3), #1656 (PANS symptom-subtype stratification for biomarker panel, P4).
- FINDING: Li et al. PNAS 2024 (PMID 39254994) — cGAS in classical DCs (NOT macrophages) drives TREX1 autoimmunity. Refines SAMHD1-EAMG interpretation for two-hit model.
- FINDING: TridentTCR (bioRxiv June 2025) — GNN+LLM for TCR specificity prediction including autoimmune targets. AIRE metric. Cross-reactivity detection demonstrated (T1D). Tool candidate for hla-peptide-presentation-modeling.
- FINDING: t2pmhc (bioRxiv Feb 2026) — structure-informed GNN for TCR-pMHC binding. Additional tool candidate.
- FINDING: GAS vaccine safety (npj Vaccines 2025) — GAC vaccination does NOT elicit rheumatic fever autoantibodies. Anti-GAC antibodies are consequence, not cause. Protein mimicry more relevant for PANDAS.
- FINDING: PANS symptoms systematic review (PMID 40367585, J Psychiatric Research July 2025) — separation anxiety, irritability, emotional lability, dysgraphia distinctive vs primary OCD.
- FINDING: NfL meta-analysis (Translational Psychiatry Jan 2025, Lai) — NfL elevated in autoimmune encephalitis (SMD=0.909) but NOT in PANS (Hesselmark 2021). Supports functional/signaling neuroinflammation hypothesis.
- FINDING: AAP rebuttal letter (July 2025) — PPN+PANDAS Network request retraction. 50+ studies omitted. Insurance IVIG approvals dropped to ~60%.
- FINDING: Trained immunity drug discovery roadmap (eLife 2025/2026) — modulators being developed. Relevant if PANS = deficient trained immunity.
- Cunningham Panel: 14th consecutive negative. PANDAS GWAS: still none. NfL in PANS: still negative. EMoMiS: zero adoption. Ghoreyshi HLA preprint: unverifiable (recommend dropping). UM-200: no follow-up. Panzyga full publication: still pending. Galosi IL-17 CSF: no follow-up. mTOR-PANS rapamycin: no clinical data.
- NEW watchlist: TridentTCR peer review, t2pmhc peer review, GAC vaccine human trials, PANS symptoms review follow-ups, AAP rebuttal outcome.
- Next run: check research_director tasks #1654/#1655/#1656, monitor Panzyga full publication, TridentTCR/t2pmhc peer review, GAC vaccine trials, AAP rebuttal resolution, continue all existing watchlist items, drop Ghoreyshi if still unfound.
